  "job_B8.1.4.4_20251003_114815": {
    "chunk_text": "\ufffdam westene, \u00f0e is genemned Pharan, twelf \u00d0is synd \u00f0ara manna naman, \u00f0e Moyses sende to sceawigenne Chanaan land. & \u00f0us cw\u00e6\u00f0: Fara\u00f0 geond \u00f0one su\u00f0d\u00e6l, & sceawia\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6t land, hw\u00e6\u00f0er hit w\u00e6stmb\u00e6re sy & mid & feria\u00f0 mid eow of \u00f0\u00e6re eor\u00f0an w\u00e6stmum, \u00f0onne ge eft cuma\u00f0; Hit w\u00e6s \u00f0a se tima \u00f0e winberian & hi ferdon \u00f0a sona & sceawodon \u00feone eard, & geond feowertig daga embferdon \u00f0one eard. & of \u00f0am winbogum mid berium mid ealle & \u00e6pplum & of\u00e6tum eft mid him brohton. & comon to Moyse, \u00fe\u00e6r he mid \u00f0\u00e6re fyrde w\u00e6s, on Pharan \u00f0am westene. & \u00f0as word him to cw\u00e6don: We comon to \u00f0am earde \u00fee ge us heton faran, \u00fee flew\u00f0 witodlice Ac \u00fea strengstan weras wunia\u00f0 on \u00f0am lande & micele burga \u00f0\u00e6r synd & m\u00e6rlice geweallode: \u00f0\u00e6r Amalech eac swylce earda\u00f0 on \u00f0am su\u00f0d\u00e6le, Etheus on \u00f0am muntlandum, & Iebuseus & Amorreus, Hw\u00e6t \u00f0a Israhela bearn endemes hrymdon ongean Moysen miclum ceorodon; ac Caleph hi gestilde, \u00d0a o\u00f0re so\u00f0lice cw\u00e6don, \u00fee mid him asende w\u00e6ron: Ne mage we faran nateshwon to \u00f0am folce \u00feus, & we \u00f0\u00e6r gesawon of \u00f0am entcynne Enachys bearna micelra w\u00e6stma, \u00f0am we ne synd \u00f0e gelicran & hi t\u00e6ldon \u00f0\u00e6t land mid heora te",
